    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Psalm 4"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Evening Prayer of Trust in God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the music director; on stringed instruments. A Psalm of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Answer me when I call, God of my righteousness!",
          "You have relieved me in my distress;",
          "Be gracious to me and hear my prayer."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶You sons of man, how long will my honor be treated as an insult?",
          "How long will you love what is worthless and strive for a lie?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But know that the Lord has set apart the godly person for Himself;",
          "The Lord hears when I call to Him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶Tremble, and do not sin;",
          "Meditate in your heart upon your bed, and be still."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Offer the sacrifices of righteousness,",
          "And trust in the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶Many are saying, “Who will show us anything good?”",
          "Lift up the light of Your face upon us, Lord!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You have put joy in my heart,",
          "More than when their grain and new wine are abundant."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "In peace I will both lie down and sleep,",
          "For You alone, Lord, have me dwell in safety."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
